stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: ERC-8004 agent identity lifecycle (Identity Registry)
  accDescr: State diagram: ERC-8004 agent identity lifecycle (Identity Registry). 6 states: Not registered, Registered, no URI, Registered with URI, wallet = owner, Wallet verified, Wallet cleared, and Declared inactive (off-chain only). Starts in Not registered. 17 transitions. From Not registered to Registered, no URI when Mint without a URI (register()). From Not registered to Registered with URI, wallet = owner when Mint with a URI (register(agentURI) or register(agentURI, metadata)). From Registered, no URI to Registered with URI, wallet = owner when Owner or operator sets the URI (setAgentURI(agentId, newURI)). From Registered with URI, wallet = owner to Registered with URI, wallet = owner when File moved or edited (setAgentURI(agentId, newURI)). From Registered with URI, wallet = owner to Wallet verified when New wallet signs AgentWalletSet within 5 minutes (setAgentWallet(agentId, newWallet, deadline, signature)). From Wallet verified to Wallet cleared when Owner or operator clears the wallet (unsetAgentWallet(agentId)). From Registered with URI, wallet = owner to Wallet cleared when Token transferred to a new owner (ERC-721 transferFrom or safeTransferFrom). From Wallet verified to Wallet cleared when Token transferred to a new owner (ERC-721 transferFrom or safeTransferFrom). From Wallet cleared to Wallet verified when Current owner binds a wallet again (setAgentWallet(agentId, newWallet, deadline, signature)). From Registered with URI, wallet = owner to Declared inactive (off-chain only) when Owner publishes a file with active false (setAgentURI(agentId, newURI) or an HTTPS file edit). From Wallet verified to Declared inactive (off-chain only) when Owner publishes a file with active false (setAgentURI(agentId, newURI) or an HTTPS file edit). From Declared inactive (off-chain only) to Registered with URI, wallet = owner when Owner publishes a file with active true (wallet state unchanged) (setAgentURI(agentId, newURI)). From Registered with URI, wallet = owner to Wallet cleared when Owner or operator clears the wallet (unsetAgentWallet(agentId)). From Registered, no URI to Wallet verified when New wallet signs AgentWalletSet (no URI needed) (setAgentWallet(agentId, newWallet, deadline, signature)). From Registered, no URI to Wallet cleared when Transfer or unset before a URI is set (ERC-721 transfer or unsetAgentWallet(agentId)). From Wallet verified to Wallet verified when Bind a different wallet (setAgentWallet(agentId, newWallet, deadline, signature)). From Wallet cleared to Declared inactive (off-chain only) when Owner publishes a file with active false (setAgentURI(agentId, newURI) or an HTTPS file edit).
  state "Not registered" as s_unregistered
  state "Registered, no URI" as s_registered_no_uri
  state "Registered with URI, wallet = owner" as s_registered
  state "Wallet verified" as s_wallet_verified
  state "Wallet cleared" as s_wallet_cleared
  state "Declared inactive (off-chain only)" as s_declared_inactive
  [*] --> s_unregistered
  s_unregistered --> s_registered_no_uri : Mint without a URI
  s_unregistered --> s_registered : Mint with a URI
  s_registered_no_uri --> s_registered : Owner or operator sets the URI
  s_registered --> s_registered : File moved or edited
  s_registered --> s_wallet_verified : New wallet signs AgentWalletSet within 5<br/>minutes
  s_wallet_verified --> s_wallet_cleared : Owner or operator clears the wallet
  s_registered --> s_wallet_cleared : Token transferred to a new owner
  s_wallet_verified --> s_wallet_cleared : Token transferred to a new owner
  s_wallet_cleared --> s_wallet_verified : Current owner binds a wallet again
  s_registered --> s_declared_inactive : Owner publishes a file with active false
  s_wallet_verified --> s_declared_inactive : Owner publishes a file with active false
  s_declared_inactive --> s_registered : Owner publishes a file with active true<br/>(wallet state unchanged)
  s_registered --> s_wallet_cleared : Owner or operator clears the wallet
  s_registered_no_uri --> s_wallet_verified : New wallet signs AgentWalletSet (no URI<br/>needed)
  s_registered_no_uri --> s_wallet_cleared : Transfer or unset before a URI is set
  s_wallet_verified --> s_wallet_verified : Bind a different wallet
  s_wallet_cleared --> s_declared_inactive : Owner publishes a file with active false
  note right of s_unregistered : No token id yet.
  note right of s_registered_no_uri : register() with no argument#59; Registered<br/>carries an empty agentURI.
  note right of s_registered : agentWallet defaults to the owner<br/>address at mint. Wallet state and URI<br/>state change independently.
  note right of s_wallet_verified : agentWallet set to another address by<br/>setAgentWallet with a signature from<br/>that address.
  note right of s_wallet_cleared : agentWallet is the zero address after<br/>unsetAgentWallet or a transfer.
  note right of s_declared_inactive : active is false in the registration<br/>file. The registry has no such state and<br/>no burn function, so the token persists.<br/>The wallet keeps whatever value it had.
